p1.text:
Variables (random order):
{names}

Using only what these names mean, group them into an ordered list of tiers so that a variable can only be influenced by variables in earlier tiers. First tier = root causes / inputs; last tier = final outcomes. Every variable must appear exactly once, spelled exactly as listed. Variables you cannot order go in the same tier.
Answer with JSON only, earliest tier first: {{"tiers": [[...], [...]]}}
